<!--
  RSW_DurasteelConvert_OuterRim.xml          mandrake.rsw.armoury

  CANON_MATERIALS_BUILD_1 L2 (design section 3.2): OuterRim_Durasteel (Neronix17.OuterRim.Core, workshop 2919227155,
  1.6 + Common folders measured 2026-10-10) is no longer produced; every use of it points at RSW_Durasteel and the
  def is removed. Loose stacks and old saves convert 1:1 through RM_DefAliasDef (alias OuterRim_Durasteel ->
  RSW_Durasteel) rather than the design's conversion recipe: an alias loses nothing and needs no bill. The mod has
  NO mining or deep-drill producer for it in 1.6 (nothing to zero); it appears only in recipe filters/costs, trader
  stock (thingDef), the Binary Star Raiders loot filter and floors. One Replace per stack count (31 counts today):
  a PatchOperationReplace cannot rename an element and keep its text. A count added by a mod update is left
  naming the removed def; validation.py (durasteel_outerrim_static) checks the shape, the counts are re-measured by
  grepping `<OuterRim_Durasteel>N<` in that mod's Defs. Every operation is a no-op when the donor is absent.
  LKDurasteel_Ore: not found in the workshop tree (searched 2026-10-10); nothing patched.
-->
